sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as Next.js UI
  participant API as API route
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
  actor A as Admin
  S->>UI: Save resume text
  UI->>API: PUT /api/student/profile
  API->>API: embed(resume) -> 384-d vector
  API->>DB: UPDATE students (text, vector, model)
  DB->>DB: trigger refreshes student_skills
  S->>UI: Open "My matches"
  UI->>API: GET /api/student/matches
  API->>DB: match_jobs_for_student(id)
  DB-->>API: ranked jobs, cosine score, matched and missing skills, eligibility
  S->>UI: Apply
  UI->>API: POST /api/student/applications
  API->>DB: INSERT application
  DB->>DB: BEFORE INSERT trigger: check_eligibility, store match_score
  alt not eligible
    DB-->>API: error HS001
    API-->>UI: 422 with the reason
  else eligible
    DB-->>UI: application created
  end
  A->>UI: Shortlist candidate
  UI->>API: POST /api/admin/applications/id/shortlist
  API->>DB: shortlist_candidate() in one transaction (row lock)
  DB->>DB: status guard (HS002), audit row, round 1 created
  DB-->>A: shortlisted and round scheduled
